s1-p31 = prose (cons "The development proceeds from constructions and identity (§§2–4), through language definitions and reflection (§§5–6), to open machine processes and their realization (§§7–9), and finally to retained inference and distributed interaction (§10). The latter are instances of the general subject, not a change from nature to software. Each stage operates on constructions already introduced, including the language through which those operations are expressed." nil)
